{{>partials/header}}<div class="auth-grid"><section class="auth-intro"><span class="eyebrow">A BETTER WAY TO MEET</span><h1>우리의 약속을<br><span class="text-accent">더 간단하게.</span></h1><p>초대 코드 하나로 모이고,<br>모두 가능한 시간과 장소를 정하세요.</p></section><section class="panel auth-card"><span class="eyebrow">GET STARTED</span><h2>회원가입</h2><p class="text-secondary">모임에서 사용할 이름과 계정을 입력하세요.</p><form method="post" action="/signup">{{>partials/csrf}}<label class="form-label" for="name">이름</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="name" name="name" value="{{signupName}}" required minlength="2" maxlength="40" autocomplete="name"><label class="form-label" for="email">이메일</label><input class="form-control mb-3" type="email" id="email" name="email" value="{{signupEmail}}" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="username"><label class="form-label" for="password">비밀번호</label><input class="form-control" type="password" id="password" name="password" required minlength="8" maxlength="60" autocomplete="new-password"><div class="form-text mb-4">8자 이상, 영문·숫자 사용을 권장해요.</div><button class="btn btn-dark w-100">계정 만들기</button></form><p class="small mt-4 mb-0">이미 계정이 있나요? <a href="/login">로그인</a></p></section></div>{{>partials/footer}}
